"Agent: a new deal matches the buy box": "代理商：新交易符合黄金购物车",
"Hello, the deal at {address} with an asking price of {asking_price} matches our buy box. Please send the seller details and a viewing date.": "您好，{address} 的交易要价为 {asking_price}，符合我们的购买框。请向卖家发送详细信息和查看日期。",
"Agent: please send comparable sales": "代理商：请发送可比销售",
"Hello, please send comparable sales for {address} from the last 12 months. We need them for the analysis.": "您好，请发送过去 12 个月中 {address} 的可比销售额。我们需要它们来进行分析。",
"Agent: our offer for the property": "代理：我们对房产的报价",
"Hello, our offer for {address} is {offer_price}, open until {valid_until}. The asking price was {asking_price}.": "您好，我们对 {address} 的报价为 {offer_price}，截止至 {valid_until}。要价是{asking_price}。",
"Agent: the counter-offer is accepted": "代理商：接受还盘",
"Hello, we accept the counter-offer for {address} at {final_price}. Please send the contract to the closing coordinator.": "您好，我们接受 {final_price} 的 {address} 还盘。请将合同发送给成交协调员。",
"Agent: we are passing on the property": "代理人：我们正在转让房产",
"Hello, we are passing on {address}. The numbers do not meet our target. Thank you for your time, please keep sending deals.": "您好，我们正在传递{address}。这些数字没有达到我们的目标。感谢您的宝贵时间，请继续发送优惠。",
"Agent: ask for the seller repair credit": "代理商：向卖家索要维修信用",
"Hello, the inspection of {address} found repairs of {repair_estimate}. Please ask the seller for a credit or a lower price.": "您好，对{address}的检查发现{repair_estimate}有修复。请向卖家索要信用额或更低的价格。",
"Loan broker: please quote a loan": "贷款经纪人：请报价贷款",
"Hello, please quote a loan for {address}: price {offer_price}, rehab {rehab_budget}. We need the rate, the points and the cash to close.": "您好，请报价 {address} 的贷款：价格 {offer_price}，康复 {rehab_budget}。我们需要费率、积分和现金才能完成交易。",
"Loan broker: compare the two quotes": "贷款经纪人：比较两个报价",
"Hello, we are comparing quotes for {address}. Please confirm the monthly payment of {payment} and the cash to close of {cash_to_close} in writing.": "您好，我们正在比较 {address} 的报价。请以书面形式确认 {payment} 的每月付款和 {cash_to_close} 的现金结账。",
"Loan broker: the appraisal came in low": "贷款经纪人：估价偏低",
"Hello, the appraisal for {address} came in below the price. Please tell us what the lender will lend now. The cash to close was {cash_to_close}.": "您好，{address} 的估价低于价格。请告诉我们贷方现在会借出什么。平仓现金为{cash_to_close}。",
"Loan broker: application documents": "贷款经纪人：申请文件",
"Hello, we are sending the documents for the loan application for {address}. Please tell us what is still missing.": "您好，我们正在发送{address}的贷款申请文件。请告诉我们还缺少什么。",
"Inspector: book the inspection": "检验员：预约检验",
"Hello, please book the inspection of {address} for {date}. Please send the report within two days.": "您好，请预约{date}对{address}的检查。请在两天内发送报告。",
"Inspector: send the report summary": "检查员：发送报告摘要",
"Hello, please send the report summary for {address}. We need the {issues_found} issues with a cost for each.": "您好，请发送{address}的报告摘要。我们需要 {issues_found} 期以及每期的费用。",
"Inspector: the repair estimate is needed": "检验员：需要维修估价",
"Hello, please add a repair estimate to the report for {address}. Our own estimate is {repair_estimate}.": "您好，请在 {address} 的报告中添加维修估算。我们自己的估计是{repair_estimate}。",
"Contractor: walk the property, price it": "承包商：走访房产，定价",
"Hello, please walk {address} and price the {category} work. Our estimate is {estimate}.": "您好，请步行 {address} 并为 {category} 的工作定价。我们的估计是{estimate}。",
"General contractor: the bid is due": "总承包商：投标已到期",
"Hello, your bid for {address} is due. Please send the price for {category}. Our estimate with contingency is {total_with_cont}.": "您好，您对 {address} 的出价已到。请发送{category}的价格。我们对意外事件的估计是{total_with_cont}。",
"Closing: the offer was accepted": "结束：要约被接受",
"Hello, our offer on {address} was accepted at {final_price}. Please open the closing file.": "您好，我们在 {address} 的报价已于 {final_price} 被接受。请打开关闭文件。"
}